# 📝 Quick Note Application

## 📌 Project Overview

The **Quick Note Application** is a simple and user-friendly web application developed using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Python Flask, and SQLite Database.

It allows users to create, save, view, and delete notes easily. All notes are stored permanently in an SQLite database.

## 🚀 Features

- Create new notes.
- Save notes to the database.
- View all saved notes.
- Delete unwanted notes.
- Automatic database creation.
- Simple and responsive user interface.
- Permanent note storage using SQLite.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- **HTML** – Webpage structure.
- **CSS** – Styling and design.
- **JavaScript** – Frontend functionality.
- **Python** – Backend programming.
- **Flask** – Web framework.
- **SQLite** – Database management.

